create a file /etc/modprobe.d/scd14.conf and entry below
install cramfs /bin/true
install squashfs /bin/true
install udf /bin/true
install usb-storage /bin/true
install dccp /bin/true
install sctp /bin/true
install rds /bin/true
install tipc /bin/true

after that this should be entry in fstab

/dev/mapper/rhel-home   /home                   xfs     defaults,nodev        0 0
/dev/mapper/rhel-tmp    /tmp                    xfs     defaults,nodev,nosuid,noexec        0 0
tmpfs /dev/shm tmpfs defaults,nodev,nosuid,noexec 0 0

if found or not found it should be entry like that 


after that run below command 

mount -o remount,rw,nodev,nosuid,noexec /tmp
mount -o remount,rw,nodev /home
mount -o remount,rw,nodev,nosuid,noexec /dev/shm/
systemctl daemon-reload
